# OPTIONAL: minimal X session, only if you want a graphical pinentry or a
# browser-free GUI for reading QR codes off a phone screen via webcam.
#
# Rename to xorg.list.chroot to enable. Adds roughly 300 MB.
# pinentry-curses is sufficient for every GnuPG operation; prefer console.
xserver-xorg-core
xserver-xorg-input-libinput
xserver-xorg-video-fbdev
xserver-xorg-video-vesa
xinit
i3-wm
xterm
pinentry-gnome3
